# Don't bundle prior builds back into the new one. AP's build flow runs
# `npm pack` from `dist/`, and without this line every historical .tgz
# sitting in dist/ would be packed into the current release — caused a
# 33 MiB 0.5.3 tarball that failed `POST /api/v1/pieces` with HTTP 413.
*.tgz

# Source maps and declaration maps are debug-only, not needed at runtime.
*.js.map
*.d.ts.map
